# chorus CEC golden vector: the TV asks for System Audio Mode on, its own path 0.0.0.0 active.
#
# Committed, never written by a test. Rust-only by declaration (CEC runs on the Linux hub
# alone): crates/cec/tests/fixtures.rs decodes these bytes to system_audio_mode_request_on.fields and encodes the
# fields back to these bytes. Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

# header: initiator 0, destination 5
05

# opcode: system_audio_mode_request
70

# operands
00 00
